      "sourceTextSha256": "066122e56bd755ca12b48ea6555bda1de1ab4c46408c1a85995243310de41377",
      "text": "Day 3 · After breakfast, a free day to discover more of the city on your own, or ask for optional tours: the Botanical Garden, the tropical islands, a samba show, Imperial Petrópolis or a helicopter flight (see Optional excursions).\n\nBotanical Garden\n\nRio · Day 3 · 4 hours\n\nTropical islands\n\nRio · Day 3 · 8 hours\n\nRio at night: samba show\n\nRio · evening · 4 hours\n\nHelicopter flight\n\nFrom Sugar Loaf · 8–9 minutes",
